  "notes": "- \uD83C\uDFE2 Yangi bo\u0027lim \u0022Filiallar bo\u0027yicha\u0022 (filial ulangan bo\u0027lsa chiqadi): barcha filiallar birga \u2014 tushum, sof foyda, ombor qoldig\u0027i, qarzdorlar\r\n- \uD83D\uDCCA Filiallar taqqoslash grafiklari: tushum ulushi, sof foyda, kunlik tushum (jami), qoldiq, qarz, xarajat, o\u0027rtacha chek, cheklar\r\n- \uD83D\uDCE6 \u0022Ombor qoldig\u0027i \u2014 barcha filiallar\u0022: har tovar har filialda nechta va jami (shtrix-kod bo\u0027yicha birlashtirilgan)\r\n- \uD83C\uDFC6 \u0022Tovarlar savdosi \u2014 barcha filiallar\u0022: har tovar bo\u0027yicha jami savdo va har filialdagi tushum\r\n- \uD83E\uDD16 Onlayn rejim Loonar X ning o\u0027z boti bilan ishlaydi \u2014 token kiritish shart emas, faqat bot holati ko\u0027rinadi\r\n- \uD83C\uDF10 Chap pastda ulanish turi doim ko\u0027rinadi: \u0022Oflayn\u0022 (baza shu kompyuterda) yoki \u0022Onlayn\u0022 (do\u0027kon bilan oxirgi aloqa)",
